      "filename": "Raikoke Island, Kuril Islands (ASTER).jpg",
      "title": "File:Raikoke Island, Kuril Islands (ASTER).jpg",
      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/1/16/Raikoke_Island%2C_Kuril_Islands_%28ASTER%29.jpg",
